pdf.js 6.4.299 (legacy build, ES modules). Vendored unmodified from
https://www.npmjs.com/package/pdfjs-dist

Used by intake/js/pdftext.js to read text and AcroForm field values out of an
uploaded PDF in the browser. Nothing is uploaded anywhere: the bytes never
leave the page.

Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). To update, replace both .mjs files from the
same pdfjs-dist version.
